# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
guide forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater
faction Alliance
levels 49-50
zone Un'Goro Crater
next forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes
pitch For characters of 49 to 50, but most quests here are level 51-53: on purpose, for their experience. The crater's beasts are 48-55 and the Gorishi silithids 51-54, so pull them one at a time.

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Noggenfogger Elixir (2662), straight after Delivery for Marin.
# Sunken Temple (`when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all`, the run at the end of 50-60/01-burning-steppes): before the
# flight on from Marshal's Refuge, one trip takes Marvon Rivetseeker's two temple quests, Into the Depths and Secret of
# the Circle (3446, 3447), which the solo route's later Feralas and Tanaris stops reach only after the run: Angelas
# Moonbreeze's The Sunken Temple (3445) at Feathermoon, Muigin's Bloodpetal to Gregan Brewspewer for Haze of Evil
# (4142, 4143) across the ferry, Marvon at the Broken Pillar for The Stone Circle (3444), its circle in Marvon's chest in
# Ratchet, and Marvon again; then back to the refuge. Hunters and Rogues take their class quest for Morphaz in the
# temple (8151 from Dorion in Darnassus, a hop from Astranaar; 8233 from Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge, with Lord
# Jorach Ravenholdt's Sealed Azure Bag from Southshore) before Azshara.

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Fly to Gadgetzan
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 67.5,51.2 "Theramore flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip The flight from Theramore lands in Gadgetzan.
  turnin 2941

step Gadgetzan
  when group 2944
  accept 2944

step Sprinkle
  turnin 2641
  accept 2661
  turnin 2661
  accept 2662                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  turnin 2662                         -- Marin, once he has brewed the elixir: a few seconds

step Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  goto 71.6,76.0 "Torwa Pathfinder"

step Torwa Pathfinder
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater.
  accept 4290

step Fresh Threshadon Carcass
  tip The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa.
  collect 11504 quest 4290            -- Piece of Threshadon Carcass

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4290
  accept 4291
  accept 4289                         -- The gorillas on Ironstone Plateau carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 56

step Lar'korwi Mates and the raft
  tip The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it.
  collect 11509 quest 4291            -- Ravasaur Pheromone Gland
  accept 3844                         -- A Wrecked Raft
  turnin 3844                         -- A Small Pack, underwater
  accept 3845
  collect 11104 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11105 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11106 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11116 x1 optional           -- A Mangled Journal
  accept 3884 optional

step Karna Remtravel
  tip Karna stands just outside the refuge.
  accept 4243

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride west back to the refuge.
  accept 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge entrance
  tip Give the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass from here on.
  accept 4141                         -- Muigin
  accept 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  accept 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  accept 3881
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"            -- Gryfe
  turnin 3884 optional                -- Williden Marshal
  turnin 3845                         -- Linken, at the back of the refuge
  accept 3908                         -- Ends with Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it
  accept 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, at the back of the cave; below ground

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: the middle and the east

step Fire Plume Ridge and the eastern jungle
  tip Ride south to Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's Crate of Foodstuffs sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle.
  collect 11316 quest 4141            -- Bloodpetal
  collect 11830 quest 4503

step Lakkari Tar Pits
  collect 11184 quest 4284            -- Blue Power Crystal
  collect 11185 quest 4284            -- Green Power Crystal
  collect 11186 quest 4284            -- Red Power Crystal
  collect 11188 quest 4284            -- Yellow Power Crystal

step Marshal's Refuge
  turnin 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, below ground
  accept 4285
  accept 4287
  accept 4288
  turnin 4141                         -- Muigin
  accept 4142                         -- For Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 2: the pylons

step Northern Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle and drop Shizzle's scales.
  goto 56.5,12.5 "Northern Crystal Pylon"
  interact 164955 quest 4285.1
  collect 11831 quest 4503            -- Webbed Pterrordax Scale
  collect 11830 quest 4503

step A-Me 01
  tip Ride east to Ironstone Plateau, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there.
  turnin 4243                         -- Below ground

step Crate of Foodstuffs
  tip Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and Fledgling Pterrordax fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop Shizzle's scales. The crate sits at the abandoned camp in the eastern jungle.
  collect 11113 quest 3881            -- Crate of Foodstuffs
  collect 11830 quest 4503            -- Webbed Diemetradon Scale

step Eastern Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the eastern cliffs.
  goto 77.2,50.0 "Eastern Crystal Pylon"
  interact 164957 quest 4287.1

step The Gorishi hive
  tip Ride south-west past Torwa: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop Un'Goro Soil; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills.
  tip Careful: Gorishi silithids are level 51-54 and cast Silithid Pox or Tunneler Acid in melee; Gorishi Workers have a 50% chance to call for help within 25 yd once they fall below 45% health.
  use 11132 quest 3883.1 @48.7,85.3 map 1449
  collect 11131 quest 3883            -- Hive Wall Sample
  collect 11018 quest 3764            -- Un'Goro Soil

step Bones and equipment
  tip Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from Diemetradons. The expedition's Research Equipment lies in the south-west jungle.
  collect 11112 quest 3881            -- Research Equipment
  collect 11114 quest 3882            -- Dinosaur Bone
  collect 11830 quest 4503            -- Webbed Diemetradon Scale

step Western Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the whole west side.
  goto 23.9,59.2 "Western Crystal Pylon"
  interact 164956 quest 4288.1

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride north along the western jungle back to the refuge.
  turnin 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge's entrance
  turnin 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  turnin 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  turnin 3881                         -- Williden Marshal
  turnin 4285                         -- J.D. Collie, below ground
  turnin 4287
  turnin 4288
  accept 4321
  turnin 4321
  level 50 only Priest,Mage

step Level 49.79
  when level<49.79
  tip Still short of level 49.79 after the refuge's hand-ins? Top up on the Pterrordax on the slopes east of Marshal's Refuge before you leave the crater.
  goto 57.0,10.2 map 1449 "Pterrordax"
  level 49.79 grind 9166               -- grind on Pterrordax

step Fly to Feathermoon
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=48.1
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip For your Sunken Temple run, at about 52: Marvon Rivetseeker's temple quests start with Angelas Moonbreeze at Feathermoon Stronghold, and Muigin's Bloodpetal goes to Gregan Brewspewer across the ferry. One trip: Feathermoon, then Marvon in Tanaris, his chest in Ratchet, Marvon again, and back to this refuge.
  goto 45.3,6.0 "Marshal's Refuge flight master"
  fly "Feathermoon"
  zone Feralas

step Angelas Moonbreeze
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=48.1
  zone Feralas
  tip Angelas Moonbreeze, in Feathermoon Stronghold, sends you to Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris.
  accept 3445                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze

step Boat to The Forgotten Coast
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 4142
  when level>=48.1
  zone Feralas
  goto 31.0,39.8 "Boat to The Forgotten Coast"

step Gregan Brewspewer
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 4142
  when level>=48.1
  zone Feralas
  tip Gregan's camp lies north of the Twin Colossals. He wants Atal'ai Haze from the temple's oozes and lurkers, for Muigin.
  turnin 4142                         -- Gregan Brewspewer
  accept 4143

step Fly to Gadgetzan
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3445
  zone Feralas
  tip Back over to the stronghold and the gryphon to Gadgetzan.
  goto 30.3,43.3 "Feathermoon flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

step Marvon Rivetseeker
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3445
  when level>=48.1
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride south-west to Marvon Rivetseeker's camp at the Broken Pillar. The Stone Circle he wants is in his chest in Ratchet.
  turnin 3445                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  accept 3444

step Fly to Ratchet
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3444
  when taxi "Ratchet"
  zone Tanaris
  goto 51.0,29.3 "Gadgetzan flight master"
  fly "Ratchet"
  zone The Barrens

step Fly to Theramore
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3444
  when !taxi "Ratchet"
  zone Tanaris
  goto 51.0,29.3 "Gadgetzan flight master"
  fly "Theramore"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh

step Ratchet
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3444
  zone The Barrens
  tip Marvon's chest stands in his workshop by Ratchet's docks.
  getfp "Ratchet"
  collect 10556 quest 3444.1 @62.5,38.5 -- Stone Circle

step Fly to Gadgetzan
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when complete 3444
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

step Marvon Rivetseeker
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when complete 3444
  when level>=48.1
  zone Tanaris
  tip Back to Marvon at the Broken Pillar. Into the Depths and Secret of the Circle are both answered inside the temple, at the Altar of Hakkar and the Idol of Hakkar.
  turnin 3444                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  accept 3446
  accept 3447

step Abandon The Sunken Temple
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3445
  tip The Sunken Temple is still in your log: the route takes it again at Feathermoon later, so abandon it now.
  abandon 3445                        -- The Sunken Temple

step Abandon The Stone Circle
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 3444
  when !complete 3444
  tip The Stone Circle is still unfinished: Marvon gives it again later on the route, so abandon it now.
  abandon 3444                        -- The Stone Circle

step Fly to Marshal's Refuge
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when zone "Tanaris"
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Warlock,Druid
  zone Tanaris
  tip Back to the refuge for the flight on.
  goto 51.0,29.3 "Gadgetzan flight master"
  fly "Marshal's Refuge"
  zone Un'Goro Crater

step Fly to Astranaar
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Warlock,Druid
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The Ironforge quests were taken at the end of the Searing Gorge guide: fly straight on to Ashenvale for Azshara.
  goto 45.3,6.0 "Marshal's Refuge flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"

step To Ironforge
  only Priest,Mage
  zone Ironforge
  goto 18.15,51.45 "Stonefire Tavern"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge (Priests and Mages)

step Mystic Ward
  only Priest,Mage
  accept 8254 npc 11406 only Priest   -- High Priest Rohan: for Ogtinc in Azshara, keep it
  accept 8250 npc 7312 only Mage      -- Dink, the mage trainer: for Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara, keep it
  train class

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  only Priest,Mage
