step Fly to Astranaar
  only Priest,Mage
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=50
  only Hunter
  zone Ashenvale
  tip For your Sunken Temple run: at 50 the hunter trainers give The Hunter's Charm, for Ogtinc in Azshara, whose last task is a tooth of Morphaz, a drake in the temple. Dorion is in Darnassus, a short flight away.
  goto 34.4,48.0 "Astranaar flight master"
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
  zone Teldrassil

step Dorion
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=50
  only Hunter
  zone Darnassus
  tip Through the portal to Darnassus: Dorion is a hunter trainer in the Cenarion Enclave.
  accept 8151 npc 4205                -- Dorion

step Fly to Astranaar
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when zone "Darnassus"
  only Hunter
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Back through the portal and the hippogryph to Astranaar.
  goto 58.4,93.9 "Rut'theran Village flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"
  zone Ashenvale

step To Ironforge
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=50
  only Rogue
  zone Ironforge
  tip For your Sunken Temple run: at 50 the rogue trainers give A Simple Request, to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt, whose chain ends with the Azure Key from Morphaz, a drake in the temple. Hearth to Ironforge for Hulfdan Blackbeard.
  goto 18.15,51.45 "Stonefire Tavern"

step Hulfdan Blackbeard
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when level>=50
  only Rogue
  zone Ironforge
  accept 8233 npc 5165                -- Hulfdan Blackbeard

step Fly to Southshore
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 8233
  only Rogue
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Southshore"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step Lord Jorach Ravenholdt
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 8233
  when level>=50
  only Rogue
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Ravenholdt Manor hides in the hills east of Tarren Mill. The trail starts behind the plateau north of Durnholde Keep, climbs into the hills and runs through a small tunnel into the Alterac Mountains; Lord Jorach is inside the manor. Don't attack anyone there: lost Ravenholdt reputation makes him refuse to speak to you. His Sealed Azure Bag is on a Timbermaw Shaman in Azshara.
  turnin 8233                         -- Lord Jorach Ravenholdt
  accept 8234

step Abandon A Simple Request
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when onquest 8233
  only Rogue
  tip A Simple Request is still in your log: the route doesn't come back to Ravenholdt before Azshara, so abandon it.
  abandon 8233                        -- A Simple Request

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when turnedin 8233
  only Rogue
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 49.4,52.1 "Southshore flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Auberdine
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when turnedin 8233
  only Rogue
  zone Wetlands
  goto 4.5,56.7 "Boat to Auberdine"

step Fly to Astranaar
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all
  when turnedin 8233
  only Rogue
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"
